Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Oh, those are so cute!  Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好可爱哦  是啊
