Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:44.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good, you're all here. Okay. Thanksgiving, tomorrow, 4:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:44.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了  你们都在  感恩节  明天四点
