Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:51.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不记得了  他跟罗斯同班
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:54.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Marching band, was kind of overweight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:54.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是军乐队的  有点胖
