Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:05.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you sure you're not talking about your imaginary boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:05.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你确定你说的不是你假想的男朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:07.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that was Jared.
