Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.67,0:01:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Haven't thought about him in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.67,0:01:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好久没有想起他了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:17.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, Will's here on business,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:17.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}威尔来城里出差
