Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.81,0:01:19.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没地方可去  所以我邀请他过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.97,0:01:23.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} That's nice.  Oh, he's lost a bunch of weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.97,0:01:23.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那很好啊  他减肥成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He looks good. Okay, I mean really gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:28.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他看起来很不错  他真的是帅呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.56,0:01:33.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I still love Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.56,0:01:33.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还爱着钱德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:36.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wouldn't hurt you to say it once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:36.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}偶尔提一次不会要你的命
