Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是的  它们既丑又蠢  但很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:58.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not just Phoebe.Will's still on a diet,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:58.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不只是菲比  威尔还在节食
