Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.06,0:01:59.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒不吃感恩节食物...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:02.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Rachel's having her aversion to poultry.  She is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:02.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋对家禽类反胃  是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:04.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Remember? I had to leave the other day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:04.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  记得吗  那天你吃烤鸡时
