Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:13.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like I showed you at Christmas. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:13.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在圣诞节时教过你  记得吗
