Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:05.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I don't know you like football.  Normally, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:05.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没听说你喜欢橄榄球  我平时不喜欢
