Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:29.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks. Will, I'm so glad that you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:29.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢  威尔  我很高兴你能来
