Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.83,0:06:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.83,0:06:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干得好
