Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:14.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要帮我吗  好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:18.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, I can't get over how great you look. You look stunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:18.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  我真的觉得你很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:20.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You look incredible too. You're so fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:20.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也很帅  你身材真棒
