Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:27.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I meant to tell you, Ross is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:27.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直想告诉你  罗斯也会来
