Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.39,0:08:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I'm rich and thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.39,0:08:13.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我现在既有钱  身材又好
