Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:48.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel Greene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:48.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋·格林
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.02,0:08:52.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that's right. Are you gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.02,0:08:52.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了  你没事吧
